## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical end-to-end debugging in a CNPA pipeline with observability, sinks, and windowing.

## Key Concepts
- End-to-end tracing across HTTP, PostgreSQL, Kafka, stream processor, Redis
- Correlation IDs, OpenTelemetry, sampling
- Idempotent sinks, transactional outbox, watermarking, checkpointing

## Code Example
```javascript
// Propagate correlation ID in Express middleware
app.use((req,res,next)=>{
  const id = req.headers['x-correlation-id'] || uuid.v4();
  req.corrId = id;
  res.setHeader('x-correlation-id', id);
  next();
});
```

